end for Terraform state • 132\nTroubleshooting common backend and permission errors • 134\nImplementing a manual approval step for production deployments .................... 134\nConfiguring a protected environment and workflow • 134\nOptimizing IaC with AI-driven suggestions and drift detection ........................... 138\nAI-assisted IaC development • 139\nAutomated plan analysis and drift detection • 139\nUse case: How Spotify leverages AI for infrastructure drift management • 140\nSummary ......................................................................................................... 140\nGet this book's PDF version and more ................................................................ 141\nJoin the CloudPro Newsletter with 44000+ Subscribers ..................................... 142"],[85984,"Chapter 7: AWS Networking Services, Part 1 – Virtual Private Cloud\n(VPCs)\n161\nUnderstanding on-premises corporate networks ................................................................... 162\nBasic corporate networks • 163\nExplaining IP addressing and subnet masks ........................................................................... 165\nIP address version 4 (IPv4) • 166\nIPv4 address limitations • 168\nSecure internet access • 170\nOverview of IPv6 • 172\nComparing network sizes and IP address classes ................................................................... 172\nWhat are subnet masks? • 174\nWhat is subnetting? • 177\nClassless Inter-Domain routing • 181\nBuilding virtual networks with Amazon VPC ........................................................................ 182\nInternet access • 184\nNetwork address translation (NAT) • 185\nSecuring VPC traffic .............................................................................................................. 186\nSecurity groups • 187\nNetwork access control lists (NACLs) • 188\nConnecting VPCs with VPC peering ...............................................................